    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "You speak as if there's a way to find that peace... But the world keeps pushing, Silas. The sun keeps coming up and the noise never stops. I don't want to just rest for a moment. I want the kind of peace that doesn't break. The kind that's as deep and quiet as the earth beneath this estate. Is that even possible? To just... finish the story?",
